    "text": "By Jay King ,\n1 days ago The building, which housed the former Cafe and Then Some, could soon be transformed into a 17-room boutique hotel, according to plans revealed during a gathering of Greenville real estate and development professionals on Feb. 4. The proposal was discussed briefly by Jason Boehm, founder and CEO of Greenville-based Aileron... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 6",
